      "label": "Tailscale Session Host (100.101.244.126)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "/mnt/sda2/website/classroom-assets/xscreenshot-20260628T103127.png",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": "2026-06-28T10:31:27",
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "The host address 100.101.244.126 is in the Tailscale CGNAT range (100.64.0.0/10), indicating the classroom session is served over the teacher's tailnet rather than the public internet, avoiding port forwarding and giving encrypted peer connectivity."
    },
    {
      "id": "classroom_assets_xscreenshot_20260628t103127_tailnet_auth_key_field",
      "label": "Tailnet Auth Key Input (optional)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "/mnt/sda2/website/classroom-assets/xscreenshot-20260628T103127.png",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": "2026-06-28T10:31:27",
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "An optional tskey-auth one-time key (generated at tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys) can be embedded so student devices not yet on the tailnet can self-enroll when they scan the QR; leaving it optional keeps the fast path for devices already joined."
    },
